{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼キリッとね(///ω///)♪／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/20/2986972/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでお仕事なう!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何のお仕事かは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また言いますね(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、ツインテールを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しようとしてさゆにゃんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ツインテールどうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/20/2986972/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とツインテールをやってみせたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斜め下を見ながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真顔の棒読みで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ツインテールかわいいーねー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月涙目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこんなで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今みんなで小さい頃の自分のあだ名について話していました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは『まりっぴ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛らしいあだ名つけてもらいやがって(｀・ω・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいは『まいっち』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいっち......これまた可愛らしいあだ名つけてもらいやがって...。〜っち は可愛いの代表。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここからひどい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなりんは『ヤンクミ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え。(笑)なぜ。理由は...小学校の時は髪が長くて二つ縛りの眼鏡だったかららしい。単純・゜・(つД｀)・゜・ちなみに、玲奈様はヤンクミが誰か知らなかったらしいです。そして、最近知った結果『怖い不良の人を束ねる人』。なんか合ってるけど違う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、私若月は『若様orわか』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳つい。一部からでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下の端から呼ばれるととても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返り辛かった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けれども、あまりあだ名というものが無かったから凄く嬉しかったなんて言えない。言えない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストは一実さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一実さんのあだ名は『カステラひとり』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........どこから何から突っ込んだらいいのか。まず、名前なのかすら何故。どうしてこのあだ名になったのかは一実さんに聞いてください(笑)簡単に触れると 跳び箱で一実さんだけがカステラを使っていたかららしいが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、しかも『カステラひとり』の替え歌まであったらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"某カステラ屋さんの歌でどうぞ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カステラ１枚♪２枚は無〜理♪♪３枚入れたら飛べるはずがない♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やべぇ、素敵すぎた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事頑張ってきます!!"},{"typ